one.webp","/images/assessment/literacy-mock/capacity/foundation-spider.webp","/images/assessment/objective-words/bread.webp","/images/assessment/objective-words/butterfly.webp","/images/assessment/objective-words/corn.webp","/images/assessment/objective-words/elbow.webp","/images/assessment/objective-words/lion.webp","/images/assessment/release-support/targets/snail-9054cc.webp","/images/child-mode/initial-sounds/reviewed/monkey.webp","Choose the name written correctly.","Hold and blend three separately recorded phonemes.","R","The exact target raster was inspected at child-card size. It contains no printed target; the instruction is spoken but every assessed word remains silent.","Which sentence starts with a capital letter?","blend_three_phonemes","bowl","crawl","go","gum","lemon","match_spoken_short_vowel_word:short_i","mud","picturedWord","sameInitialAlternatives","seven","sound_manipulation","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/goat-e967028b8b.mp3","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/hop-02f63976ff.mp3","/images/assessment/long-vowels/tree.webp","/images/assessment/objective-words/cake.webp","let","listening_where","listening_who","orange","ride","rod","shake","u","/audio/production/en-US/assessment_prompt/which-choice-is-a-complete-sentence-f55d6f72c6.mp3","/images/assessment/objective-words/pan.webp","F","Recognise the supplied spoken HFW among two real words with at least 3 letter edits; whole-word shape separates the alternatives.","Which choice is a complete sentence?","Y","bib","by","dam","glass","him","hug","hut","jug","man","match_spoken_short_vowel_word:short_e","one","pup","rag","ran","sentence_boundary","sum","tag","towel","yam","/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/leaf-eba16ea6ff.mp3","/images/assessment/digraphs/dolphin.webp","/images/assessment/digraphs/shark.webp","/images/assessment/digraphs/whale.webp","/images/assessment/generated/initial-sounds-l2/penguin.webp","/images/assessment/long-vowels/snow.webp","/images/assessment/objective-wo