ide a sheet of stickers among the crown makers.","Divide loose beans between trays before carrying them.","Draw a ribbon pattern before removing its ribbons.","Draw block positions when describing a complicated pattern.","Eva","Feed the class fish before joining a game.","Find a spare ruler before drawing a chart.","Find out which door a collector actually means.","Give a beginning player a cue for their own part.","Give growing seedlings room between their leaves.","Hang bags on hooks to leave reading seats free.","Ian","Ida","Include strip lengths as well as how many to cut.","Include the day as well as the picnic time.","Ivy","JH","Jay","Joe","Joy","Kai","Keep a trumpet opening clear of a decorative bow.","Keep clean paper pieces for another group to use.","Keep loose map pages sheltered from the wind.","Keep paper shop signs sheltered from the rain.","Keep the magnifier on its labelled shelf.","Keep wet paintings apart while they are drying.","Keep wrapping paper away from a cart’s moving wheels.","Kim","Leo","Let a glued handle become firm before lifting.","Let a painted tile dry before wrapping it.","Level a tower base before rebuilding its top.","Line up strip ends before comparing their lengths.","Look inside a bag before deciding it is empty.","Loosen a knot instead of pulling both ends.","Make name labels so visitors can identify display pictures.","Mark drawers that have already been searched for a stamp.","Mark each point so a game score can be checked.","Mark shelves so they return to the correct spaces.","May","Meg","Move a plant into another pot when its pot breaks.","Move one light panel to try a scenery job.","Name a door and its nearby landmark for a visitor.","Name an object and its shelf when asking for it.","Offer a number of decorations you have time to finish.","Omits the required initial capital for sentence_capital.","Practice short drum phrases before joining the pattern.","Practise a game’s goal with a child who is new.","Put a gift inside before tying its box shut.","Put a large model on a table away from a doorway.","Put a picture list where younger children can see.","Put game counters back in their own game box.","Put the event banner beside your bag the night before.","Read a coat name before taking a similar coat.","Read seed names before choosing what to plant.","Record useful details before they are easy to forget.","Record who borrows each shared classroom puppet.","Repair a loose wheel before decorating a working cart.","Replace a cracked tray that keeps leaking water.","Restore a scattered board before asking for another game.","Save a scene plan before changing its written ending.","Separate complete sentences using full stops, question marks and exclamation marks.","Set out a mold before mixing material for it.","Set out painting tools before pouring the paint.","Share the weight when a crate is too heavy to lift.","Show a new pupil what a classroom signal means.","Show beat marks when teaching a remembered drum rhythm.","Show how to find an edge before returning puzzle pieces.","Sort scattered score cards into their proper order.","Split costumes between bags that can close properly.","Start runners from the same line when comparing speed.","Start timing each toy car at its start line.","Stop adding soap when there is enough for washing.","Substitutes another child for the person named as doing this action.","Substitutes another family member for the person named as doing this action.","Sue","THE","Take short turns when two players share a drum.","Tell a waiting friend when the meeting place moves.","Tell every helper when the shop opening time changes.","Tell the referee when a recorded score needs changing.","Test each carrying handle before lifting the box.","Test unfamiliar paint on a piece of spare paper.","Tom","Try a short shaker rhythm before joining a song.","Turn a model opening toward the person watching.","Turn a puzzle piece rather than forcing it down.","Use a funnel when 