rrection.","Add more water before checking the soil in a pot.","Agree on a plan before working together. This applies to both different mistakes and their corrections.","Agree on a plan before working together. This explains the change from the mistake to its correction.","All the new books were below the top shelf.","All trays other than the green one had two cups.","Anya pulled one handle on a carrying box to check it. When she lifted both handles, the unchecked handle came loose. After repairing it, she tested each handle separately before carrying the box.","Anyone in the show wearing a blue ribbon was a dancer, not a singer.","Apples were in all the baskets; pears were in just one.","Arlo","Arun crowded the drying rack with wet paintings touching edge to edge. Two pictures stuck together. He moved the next paintings onto separate spaces with gaps between them. They dried without sticking.","Ask a visitor to try each door in turn.","Ask before using something that belongs to another person. This applies to both different mistakes and their corrections.","Ask before using something that belongs to another person. This explains the change from the mistake to its correction.","Ask people to step over a model in a doorway.","Ask walkers which direction they want to go.","Ask what help is wanted before changing someone’s work. This applies to both different mistakes and their corrections.","Ask what help is wanted before changing someone’s work. This explains the change from the mistake to its correction.","Aya packed a painted clay tile while its surface was still wet. The wrapping stuck to the picture. She painted a new tile and left it on the rack until it was dry before wrapping it.","Bea","Bees carry pollen between different flowering plants.","Bees collect nectar to take to their hive.","Bees keep their hive warm at night.","Begin the next round before a newcomer understands the goal.","Ben rebuilt the top of his block tower whenever it leaned. It kept leaning 