elves. she kept returning to shelves she had already searched. she began at one end and checked each shelf in turn. on the next shelf she found the book.","tariq kept searching the same three drawers for a missing stamp. he could not remember which ones he had checked. he placed an empty card beside each searched drawer and moved to the next one. he found the stamp in a new drawer.","teeth","tess hid a paint spill until she worried the model was ruined. she told gran and they cleaned it. arun concealed a torn costume because he felt embarrassed. after telling his teacher, he learned a stitch and mended it before the play.","tess pushed all her seedlings into one corner of the tray. their leaves overlapped and bent. she moved them farther apart into the empty spaces. the leaves no longer pressed against one another. arun crowded the drying rack with wet paintings touching edge to edge. two pictures stuck together. he moved the next paintings onto separate spaces with gaps between them. they dried without sticking.","tess pushed all her seedlings into one corner of the tray. their leaves overlapped and bent. she moved them farther apart into the empty spaces. the leaves no longer pressed against one another.","tess spilled paint on her model and hid it. when she asked gran for help, they cleaned it before the paint dried.","tess switched on a lamp after looking at a map. she had closed a book before looking at the map.","test","testing the microphone happens before closing the window, which happens before setting out the chairs; the account opens by mentioning a later event.","the actors stopped the fan after moving the screen. moving the screen happened after they took a bow.","the baker sprinkled seeds over the loaf.","the baker wiped the bench after setting the timer. the timer was set after the flour was weighed.","the borrowed book stayed in noor’s bag during the game.","the broken mug held mira’s paintbrushes.","the builder","the cake cooled on the wire rack after baking.","the captain","the caretaker opened the side gate.","the children’s bags stayed in the lockers during the visit.","the class clapped for lou after moving the drums. before moving the drums, they had sung a song.","the class drew the labels after opening the packet. before opening the packet, they had counted the pots.","the class lifted the magnet after folding the cloth. before folding the cloth, they had drawn a line.","the class map hung beside the clock.","the cleaner","the coach left the cones by the fence.","the coin","the cyclist folded the rag after rolling in the bike. before rolling in the bike, he had hung up his helmet.","the diver carried a camera beneath the water.","the does not match the supplied spoken_to_print_high_frequency_word_recognition evidence.","the drawing","the finished banner was hung above the hall entrance.","the gardener lifted the heavy stone.","the gardener","the goalkeeper collected the orange bibs.","the goalkeeper","the group ate their apples after taking a photo. before taking the photo, they had counted the bags.","the group began a game without explaining it to a new child. she ran to the wrong end and stopped. they showed her the goal and played a slow round together before starting again.","the group decorated a cart while its loose wheel still wobbled. the cart could not carry their bags. they fixed the wheel first on the next cart, then added ribbons when it rolled properly.","the group drank water after colouring the picture. they had crossed the bridge before colouring the picture.","the group found the tape after clipping up the plan. they had measured the card before clipping up the plan.","the helper","the keeper counted the visitors after filling the trough. before filling the trough, she closed the shade.","the keeper set the injured bird free after it healed.","the letter","the librarian repaired the torn poster.","the librarian","the library van carries books on shelves with bars across the front. the 